.TH batten-land-replay 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-land\-replay \- Advance the base and replay this branch onto it, recording the outcome
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten land replay\fR [\fB\-\-resolve\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIreference\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Advance the base and replay this branch onto it, recording the outcome
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-resolve\fR
A path whose conflict is resolved in the worktree (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIreference\fR>
The remote reference to replay onto
